{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98704","id":2156655104,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ai_IA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98704","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98704.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98704.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98704","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98704/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98704/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98704/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4f386a7cae12c5a6be46589e502ef6b667aa3495","number":98704,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Avoid infinite recursion between AnimationPlayer and AnimationMixer","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In theory `AnimationPlayer.current_animation` shouldn't be setted directly but in normal cases that don't cause any problem unless the animation key set `current_animation` to an empty string, in this case will start an infinite recursion between `AnimationPlayer` calling `AnimationMixer::_blend_process` and `AnimationMixer` setting the current animation to a empty string which will never stop until the engine crashes. This fix makes `AnimationMixer` ignore these animation keys (that would do nothing anyways) and avoid the crash.\r\n\r\nFix: #98076","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-10-31T16:35:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T22:00:14Z","closed_at":"2026-02-23T18:08:05Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"matheusmdx:avoid-anim-player-infinite-recursion","ref":"avoid-anim-player-infinite-recursion","repo":{"id":800304948,"node_id":"R_kgDOL7OvNA","name":"godot","full_name":"matheusmdx/godot","owner":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_u